{'symbol': 'BKNG', 'date': '2022-07-13 11:20:00', 'title': 'OPENTABLE ANNOUNCES 100 BEST RESTAURANTS FOR OUTDOOR DINING FOR 2022', 'text': "MORE AL FRESCO SPOTS TO LOVE: OPENTABLE DATA SHOWS 54% INCREASE IN RESTAURANTS LISTING OUTDOOR DINING NATIONWIDE SAN FRANCISCO , JULY 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- OUTDOOR DINING IS HEATING UP, AND THIS YEAR, DINERS WILL FIND MORE PATIOS AND STREETERIES TO LOVE: NATIONWIDE DATA FROM OPENTABLE (PART OF BOOKING HOLDINGS INC. , NASDAQ: BKNG ) SHOWS THE NUMBER\xa0OF RESTAURANTS LISTING OUTDOOR DINING GREW 54% COMPARED TO PRE-PANDEMIC 2019.1 \xa0AND IT'S A GOOD THING, BECAUSE DINERS ARE EAGER TO DINE AL FRESCO: THIS YEAR, MANY CITIES COAST-TO-COAST SAW DOUBLE DIGIT INCREASES IN OUTDOOR DINING RESERVATIONS FROM APRIL – MAY, AND AGAIN FROM MAY – JUNE.2 TO HELP DINERS DISCOVER A NEW FAVORITE SPOT FOR OUTDOOR DINING, OPENTABLE RELEASED ITS ANNUAL LIST OF THE 100 BEST RESTAURANTS FOR OUTDOOR DINING , CURATED FROM 13.6 MILLION VERIFIED DINER REVIEWS.3\xa0 THE LIST IDENTIFIES RESTAURANTS COAST-TO-COAST WITH GREAT VIEWS, DELICIOUS CUISINE AND ABOVE ALL, AN INCREDIBLE OUTDOOR DINING EXPERIENCE. THIS YEAR, 25 STATES FEATURE RESTAURANTS ON THE LIST, MAKING SEEKING OUT ONE – OR MANY – A BREEZE, WHETHER AT HOME OR AWAY."}